    Errors: signals \code{ValueError} when the order has not been placed, so there is no parent to act on; \code{BadRequestError} when the part path is malformed; \code{NotFoundError} when the engine holds no parent with this id, or the plan has no part at this path; \code{ConflictError} when the part has already finished, or is kept whole and has not started, or the plan has finished; \code{ServiceUnavailableError} when the order engine is not running; and another \code{UnifiedBrokerInterfaceError} subclass for any other failure reported by, or on the way to, UBI.
